  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, while transformed the magical girl may, as a standard action, fire a blast of magical energy at a target in medium range (100 feet + 10 feet per level). This is a melee or ranged touch attack that deals 2d6 points of damage. At 3rd level and every 2 levels thereafter the amount of damage dealt increases by 2d6. This damage is extra damage and is not multiplied on a critical hit, or with feats like Vital Strike.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magical-girl#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
